 announced that 
@PlotWorkspace
 raised a $10M round led by 
@camillericketts
 at 
@xyz_vc
 and 
@DustinMoring
 at 
@MischiefVC
! Grateful to have 
@alexisohanian
 and 
@sevensevensix
 continue investing and to welcome from 
@ACME
 VC. For the past 1.5 years, we've been building the video intelligence layer for social. Most of what people think, buy, eat, wear, and care about shows up in video now and almost none of it gets tagged. We had early conviction the world had moved to video but the tools to understand consumers hadn't. What surprised us: how many different teams needed the same underlying intelligence. → Community teams wanted to understand and engage their biggest fans → Research teams wanted faster answers to hyper-specific questions → Influencer teams wanted a better way to find, vet, and track creators Today Plot is used by teams at Visa, PepsiCo, Fenty Beauty, Benefit, Canva, Mastercard, CAVA, lululemon, and many others. ARR is up 3.8x YoY. NRR is 132%. I've spent my whole career in social — Apple, then an agency, now Plot. For years the conversation was about proving social mattered. What excites me now is what happens when social teams finally have infrastructure built for them. The next chapter is the agentic layer on top of it: → An analyst across millions of videos → A community manager that identifies and engages your biggest advocates at scale → An influencer marketer that handles the operational work slowing teams down The best tech gives people more time for what they're uniquely good at. For marketers, that's creativity. That's the Plot bar. Thank you to our customers, investors, and team. We're hiring!

